FROM golang:1.27.3-bookworm@sha256:972b4110ba0f47539a975c31e52c64765e1ff19f2d74469ae4a595c6676e80a5 AS build
WORKDIR /src
ADD https://api.github.com/repos/livekit/livekit/tarball/v1.13.10 /tmp/source.tar.gz
RUN echo "2ba8e0fb0565f0b1d3b164279283832a8578784c71593fb16a8a210914e4fe9e  /tmp/source.tar.gz" | sha256sum -c - && tar -xzf /tmp/source.tar.gz --strip-components=1
RUN go get golang.org/x/net@v0.60.0 golang.org/x/crypto@v0.58.0 && go mod tidy
RUN CGO_ENABLED=0 go build -trimpath -ldflags="-s -w" -o /livekit-server ./cmd/server
FROM debian:bookworm-slim@sha256:67b30a61dc87758f0caf819646104f29ecbda97d920aaf5edc834128ac8493d3
COPY --from=build /livekit-server /livekit-server
USER 65532:65532
ENTRYPOINT ["/livekit-server"]
